sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer
  participant W as Website + its server
  participant J as Backend + database
  participant M as M-Pesa Daraja
  C->>W: Place order (area, M-Pesa number)
  W->>J: POST /api/orders
  Note over J: Lock stock, save the order,<br/>items, stock movement, delivery
  J->>M: STK push for the total
  M-->>J: CheckoutRequestID
  J-->>W: Saved, payment PENDING
  M->>C: PIN prompt on the phone
  C->>M: Enters PIN
  par Callback, needs the tunnel
    M->>J: POST .../mpesa-callback/stk
  and Status check, no tunnel needed
    W->>J: Order page polls the order
    J->>M: STK status query (max every 8 s)
  end
  Note over J: Paid: order PAID<br/>Failed: CANCELLED, stock returned
  W-->>C: Confirmed, or why it failed
